ty, market, and credit risks; and provides recruitment services, safety deposit boxes, private banking services, wealth management, asset management, investment banking, and shares brokerage services, as well as correspondent banking products and services, including money market and foreign exchange. The company was formerly known as The National Commercial Bank and changed its name to The Saudi National Bank in April 2021. The Saudi National Bank was founded in 1950 and is headquartered in Riyadh, the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia."}, "tradingview_symbol": "TADAWUL:1180", "quote": {"security_id": 1008, "price": 39.919998, "prev_close": 39.48, "change": 0.439999, "change_pct": 1.114485, "day_open": 39.799999, "day_high": 39.939999, "day_low": 39.439999, "volume": 1519067, "quoted_at": "2026-07-26T15:16:56.645004"}, "scores": {"id": 1007, "security_id": 1008, "as_of": "2026-07-26", "fundamental": 61.97, "technical": 66.81, "momentum": 70.67, "quality": 62.5, "risk": 85.0, "composite": 66.89, "pabrai": 62.3, "breakdown": {"fundamental": {"score": 61.97, "coverage": 0.75, "weight_present": 0.75, "metrics": {"roe": {"label": "Return on equity", "value": 0.126379, "sub_score": 50.55, "weight": 0.14, "contribution": 7.077}, "net_margin": {"label": "Net margin", "value": 0.612412, "sub_score": 100.0, "weight": 0.1, "contribution": 10.0}, "roa": {"label": "Return on assets", "value": 0.021617, "sub_score": 18.01, "weight": 0.08, "contribution": 1.4408}, "revenue_growth": {"label": "Revenue growth", "value": 0.092029, "sub_score": 54.87, "weight": 0.1, "contribution": 5.487}, "eps_growth": {"label": "EPS growth", "value": 0.174419, "sub_score": 68.6, "weight": 0.1, "contribution": 6.86}, "debt_to_equity": {"label": "Debt / equity", "value": 0.655509, "sub_score": 73.78, "weight": 0.1, "contribution": 7.378}, "fcf_margin": {"label": "Free-cash-flow margin", "value": 0.140432, "sub_score": 93.62, "weight": 0.05, "contribution": 4.681}, "piotroski_f": {"label": "Piotroski F-Score", "